---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Peggy Hsieh — Learning Experience & Products"
  description="I design learning experiences, and I build with AI for the people who make learning happen — at TalentLabs, at Dao Dao, and in a live solo build."
>
  <!-- ==== 1. HERO ====================================================== -->
  <section class="wrap hero">
    <p class="hero__eyebrow">Learning experience · Building products for the people who make learning happen</p>
    <h1>Peggy Hsieh</h1>
    <div class="hero__lines">
      <p>I design learning experiences, and I build with AI for the people who make learning happen.</p>
      <p>The thread through all of it, helping people start, and helping them finish.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==== 2. WHAT I'M WORKING ON ==================================== -->
  <section class="wrap section">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="section__kicker">What I'm working on</p>
    </div>

    <ul class="work-grid">
      <li class="work-card">
        <p class="work-card__role">Learning Experience Design · 2022 – present</p>
        <h3 class="work-card__title">TalentLabs</h3>
        <p class="work-card__desc">
          Empowering tech, business, and HR professionals by aligning corporate goals with learner needs. I lead learning experience design to create journeys that drive real behavioral change, not just motivation.
        </p>
        <ul class="work-card__tags">
          <li><span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--blue">B2B enterprise</span></li>
          <li><span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--blue">AI capability</span></li>
          <li><span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--outline">Learning design</span></li>
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li class="work-card">
        <p class="work-card__role">Product Strategy · 2023 – present</p>
        <h3 class="work-card__title">
          <a class="uwp-link" href="https://daodao.so" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dao Dao →</a>
        </h3>
        <p class="work-card__desc">
          An LMS designed for mentors to boost learner engagement and community. I led product direction, competitor research, rapidly taking the platform from concept to launch.
        </p>
        <ul class="work-card__tags">
          <li><span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--blue">Product strategy</span></li>
          <li><span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--blue">Edtech</span></li>
          <li><span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--outline">MVP</span></li>
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li class="work-card">
        <p class="work-card__role">Solo build · shipped 2026</p>
        <h3 class="work-card__title">
          <a class="uwp-link" href="https://www.in-betweens.cc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">in-betweens.cc →</a>
        </h3>
        <p class="work-card__desc">
          A solo-developed online Lenormand divination app. Built entirely from concept to launch using AI (primarily Claude), proving my ability to both define a clear product vision and independently execute it.
        </p>
        <ul class="work-card__tags">
          <li><span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--blue">Solo build</span></li>
          <li><span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--blue">AI-assisted</span></li>
          <li><span class="uwp-tag uwp-tag--outline">Web app</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="work-card__link">
          <a class="uwp-link" href="https://github.com/peggy1213-create" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">See more on GitHub →</a>
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <!-- ==== 3. HOW I WORK ============================================= -->
  <section class="wrap section">
    <div class="section__head">
      <p class="section__kicker">How I work</p>
    </div>

    <ul class="work-grid">
      <li class="work-card">
        <h3 class="work-card__title">Bridging Vision and Execution</h3>
        <p class="work-card__desc">
          Great educational concepts need actionable strategies. I excel at aligning corporate business goals with the practical needs of the educational frontline, ensuring cross-functional partnerships thrive.
        </p>
      </li>

      <li class="work-card">
        <h3 class="work-card__title">AI-Driven Agility</h3>
        <p class="work-card__desc">
          I deeply integrate AI into my workflow to drive product strategy and project execution. From competitor research and user insights to drafting PRDs, I leverage AI to accelerate the journey from concept to prototype.
        </p>
      </li>

      <li class="work-card">
        <h3 class="work-card__title">End-to-End Collaboration</h3>
        <p class="work-card__desc">
          Drawing on my experience with B2B clients and global higher-ed partnerships, I build clear performance frameworks across the project lifecycle. From needs assessment to execution, I seamlessly guide diverse stakeholders toward consensus across different cultures.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .work-grid {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--uwp-space-6);
  }
  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .work-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }
  .work-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--uwp-space-3);
    padding: var(--uwp-space-6);
    border: 1px solid var(--uwp-color-border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--uwp-radius-lg, 12px);
    background: var(--uwp-color-surface, transparent);
  }
  .work-card__role {
    font-size: var(--uwp-text-sm);
    color: var(--uwp-color-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .work-card__title {
    font-size: var(--uwp-text-xl);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .work-card__desc {
    color: var(--uwp-color-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .work-card__tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--uwp-space-2);
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: var(--uwp-space-1) 0 0;
  }
  .work-card__link {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: var(--uwp-space-2);
    font-size: var(--uwp-text-sm);
  }
</style>
